WAIT 1000
SEND spin &
EXPECT spin 0
EXPECT sh>
WAIT 500
SEND hi
EXPECT hi: user program running
SEND copyedge
EXPECT COPYEDGE PASS
SEND guardtest
EXPECT GUARD PASS
SEND badaccess
EXPECT TEST-3a PASS
EXPECT TEST-3b PASS
SEND dumppt
EXPECT DUMPPT COMMAND
EXPECT DUMP-PAGETABLE begin
EXPECT DUMP-PAGETABLE end
SEND memcap
EXPECT TEST-4 PASS
